           _N_O_T_E_: In order to have this feature working as expected SSSD must
           be running as "root" and not as the unprivileged user.

       autofs_provider (string)
           The autofs provider used for the domain. Supported autofs providers
           are:

           "ldap" to load maps stored in LDAP. See ssssssdd--llddaapp(5) for more
           information on configuring LDAP.

           "ipa" to load maps stored in an IPA server. See ssssssdd--iippaa(5) for
