       subdomain_homedir (string)
           Use this homedir as default value for all subdomains within this
           domain in IPA AD trust. See _o_v_e_r_r_i_d_e___h_o_m_e_d_i_r for info about
           possible values. In addition to those, the expansion below can only
           be used with _s_u_b_d_o_m_a_i_n___h_o_m_e_d_i_r.

           %F
               flat (NetBIOS) name of a subdomain.

           The value can be overridden by _o_v_e_r_r_i_d_e___h_o_m_e_d_i_r option.

